input_format:
The first line contains an integer T, the number of market days. Each market day is given as follows:
a line with an integer N;
N lines, the i-th containing two integers k_i and p_i.

The first line contains an integer T. Each of the next T lines contains a character op and a string X, separated by one space:
if op is E, print the encoding of X;
if op is D, print the string whose encoding is X.
